OL,4,B'Officials can't use common sense' -   
OL,5,Bwas Rogers handball correct?           
OL,6,GIt is rare when a key handball         
OL,7,Gdecision is given for the widespread   
OL,8,Gresponse to be "that is correct".      
OL,10,FOften the discussion centres on the    
OL,11,Fdesire for a seemingly more lenient    
OL,12,Finterpretation taking into account     
OL,13,Fperceived intent.                      
OL,15,FAnd that is again a talking point      
OL,16,Fafter the crucial penalty given        
OL,17,Fagainst Chelsea in Saturday's 4-1 home 
OL,18,Fdefeat by Leeds which ended up putting 
OL,19,Fthe visitors ahead for the first time. 
